# stevoapp.com redirect + shadowing rules.
#
# /hq.html is the LOCAL copy of the dashboard that scripts/regen-dashboard.py
# commits so either machine can read the board offline. It is a fully rendered
# page with no password on it, and it lives under web/ — which is this site's
# publish directory. Once the site builds from this repo (rather than the old
# drag-and-drop mirror that happened to omit the file), it would otherwise be
# served publicly at stevoapp.com/hq.html.
#
# The trailing ! forces this rule to win even though the file exists, so the
# only way to read the board on the public internet stays the password gate at
# /hq -> /api/hq. Do not remove this without also moving hq.html out of web/.
/hq.html   /hq   301!
